1.cat <file> => print file contents
2.touch <file> => creates file
3.cp <src> <des> => copy a file
4.mv <src> <des> => move/rename a file
5.rm <file> => remove a file
6.head <file> => print first 10 lines
7.tail<file> => print last 10 lines
8.tail -f <file> => print last 10 lines and any few lines added to file
